et Corps (NCC) About Admission Admissions to professional courses in Mangalayatan University are based on Entrance Examinations conducted by the University (National and Regional) or by Central/State government agencies. Each of these has a specified quota of intake. Seats left vacan\nt in one quota may be filled by admissions in other quotas. Admissions to all other courses are based on the merit in the qualifying examination. How to Apply The prospectus and application form can be obtained from the Admission Cell at the MUJ campus by paying a non-refundable fee of ₹500 through cash, ch\nth modern facilitates, various clubs and societies and numerous cultural and sporting events, students have a great experience during their course tenure.  Read More Student Facilities The university provides a wide range of student facilitation services designed to help students grow academically, professionally, and personally. Mangalayatan University Jabulpur \nth modern facilitates, various clubs and societies and numerous cultural and sporting events, students have a great experience during their course tenure.  Student Facilities The university provides a wide range of student facilitation services designed to help students grow academically, professionally, and personally. Mangalayatan University Jabulpur boasts mod\nnu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children menu-item-9566\"> Faculty Of Legal Studies &#038; Research <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"kadence-svg-icon kadence-ar\nype-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2281\"> BA LLB \ne-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2283\"> LLB (Hons) \n-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2284\"> LLM 1 Year \n-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-9252\"> LLM 2Year Law Course \ncustom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children menu-item-9567\"> Faculty of Business Management <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"kadence-svg-icon kadence-arrow-down-s\nject-page menu-item-2278\"> BCA \nobject-page menu-item-2277\