tion : 3 Years M.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : B.Sc. Forensic Science Duration : 2 Years Contact Now\nB.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : (10+2) with PCM/PCB from a recognized board. Duration : 3 Years\nM.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : B.Sc. Forensic Science Duration : 2 Years\nDepartment Of Medical and Allied Health Science Diploma Medical Lab. Technician DMLT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB Duration : 2 Years Bachelor Medical Lab. Technician BMLT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM Duration : 3 Years Bachelor of X-Ray Radiographer Technician BXRT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM Duration : 3 Years Bachelor of Physiotherapy BPT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB Duration : 4.5 Years Contact Now\nDiploma Medical Lab. Technician DMLT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB Duration : 2 Years\nBachelor Medical Lab. Technician BMLT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM Duration : 3 Years\nBachelor of X-Ray Radiographer Technician BXRT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM Duration : 3 Years\nBachelor of Physiotherapy BPT Eligibility : 50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB Duration : 4.5 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_2.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Engineering & Technology: MU Jabalpur\nVaried Engineering courses like Computer Science at graduate and post graduate level are offered for best career progression.\nTheoretical and research based learning incorporates practical, hands-on experience through laboratory work are best tools for imparting technical programs. Theoretical knowledge to real-world problems helps students to acquire knowledge in the form of practical experience.\nStrong industry collaboration with top companies to ensure that our courses are relevant and according to the need of the industry.\nTechnical education is guided by the best faculty- teachers and technologists, researchers and people from the corporate world.\nTechnical Innovation & Entrepreneurship are highly encouraged and appreciated.\nExcellent placement and internship opportunities in leading organizations\nProgrammes Offered in Engineering Department\nB.Tech CSE Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 4 Years M.Tech CSE Eligibility : B.Tech in relevant field Duration : 2 Years PhD CSE Eligibility : Post Graduate Duration : 3 Years Apply Now\nB.Tech CSE Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 4 Years\nM.Tech CSE Eligibility : B.Tech in relevant field Duration : 2 Years\nPhD CSE Eligibility : Post Graduate Duration : 3 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_3.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment Of Computer Application\nProgrammes Offered in Computer Application Department\nBCA Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 3 Years MCA Eligibility : Graduate with 50% marks (with Mathematics as one of the subjects) Duration : 2 Years Apply Now\nBCA Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 3 Years\nMCA Eligibility : Graduate with 50% marks (with Mathematics as one of the subjects) Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_4.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Management Studies: MU Jabalpur\nStrong industry collaboration with top companies to ensure that our courses are relevant and according to the need of the industry\nMBA education is guided by the best faculty - teachers and technologists, researchers and people from the corporate world\nInnovation & Entrepreneurship are highly encouraged and appreciated\nExcellent placement and internship opportunities in leading organizations\nProgrammes Offered in Management Department\nBBA Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3 Years MBA Eligibility : Graduation Duration : 2 Years Apply Now\nBBA Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3 Years\nMBA Eligibility : Graduation Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_5.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment Of Commerce\nBachelor of Commerce (B.Com)\nMaster of Commerce (M.Com)\n\\n===== mu_catalog_6.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Arts - MU Jabalpur\nSharpening the creative talent of students and helping them to evolve as a better leader and decision makers\nEngaging interdisciplinary studies to promote learning and employability skills among students\nOrganizing placement meetings and career-oriented workshops to make students aware of the scope of humanity education\nStrengthening the values of nation building and social harmony among students\nProgrammes Offered in Arts Department\nBA Economics, English, Sociology, Psychology, Political Science Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 3 Years MA Economics, English, Sociology, Psychology, Political Science Eligibility : Graduation Duration : 2 Years Apply Now\nBA Economics, English, Sociology, Psychology, Political Science Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 3 Years\nMA Economics, English, Sociology, Psychology, Political Science Eligibility : Graduation Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_7.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Agriculture\nProgrammes Offered in Agriculture Department\nB.Sc (Hons.) Agriculture Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years B.Sc (Hons.) Horticulture Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years B.Sc (Hons.) Forestry Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years M.Sc Agriculture Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years M.Sc Horticulture Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years M.Sc Forestry Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years Apply Now\nB.Sc (Hons.) Agriculture Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years\nB.Sc (Hons.) Horticulture Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years\nB.Sc (Hons.) Forestry Eligibility : 10+2 with Science Duration : 4 Years\nM.Sc Agriculture Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years\nM.Sc Horticulture Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years\nM.Sc Forestry Eligibility : B.sc(H) Agriculture with 50% Marks Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_8.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment Of Law Courses\nBachelors' of Legislative Law, (LLB)\nBA LLB (H)\nMaster of Law (LLM)\nLaw Programmes Offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\nDepartment of Law BA LLB Eligibility : 50% marks in 10+2 Duration : 5 Years LLB Eligibility : 50% marks in graduation Duration : 3 Years LLM Eligibility : Graduation in any stream Duration : 2 Years\nBA LLB Eligibility : 50% marks in 10+2 Duration : 5 Years\nLLB Eligibility : 50% marks in graduation Duration : 3 Years\nLLM Eligibility : Graduation in any stream Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_9.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Pharmacy: MU Jabalpur\nPharmacy education is guided by the best faculty- teachers and technologists, researchers and people from the corporate world\nInnovation & Entrepreneurship are highly encouraged and appreciated\nExcellent placement assistance and internship opportunities in leading organization\nPharmacy Programmes Offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\nDepartment of Pharmacy B.Pharma Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2 Duration : 4 Years D.Pharma Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2 Duration : 2 Years\nB.Pharma Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2 Duration : 4 Years\nD.Pharma Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2 Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_10.html =====\nApply Now\nDepartment of Science\nVaried courses in Science like Forensic Science at both graduate and post graduate level, to offer best career progression.\nTheoretical and research based learning incorporates practical, hands-on experience through laboratory work are best tools for imparting technical programs. Theoretical knowledge to real-world problems helps students to acquire knowledge in the form of practical experience.\nStrong industry collaboration with top companies to ensure that our courses are relevant and according to the need of the industry.\nScientific education is guided by the best faculty - teachers and technologists, researchers and people from the corporate world.\nTechnical Innovation & Entrepreneurship are highly encouraged and appreciated.\nExcellent placement and internship opportunities in leading organizations\nScience Programmes Offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\nDepartment of Science B.Sc. (H) Information Technology Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3 Years B.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3Years M.Sc. Information Technology Eligibility : B.Sc. IT Duration : 2 Years M.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : B.Sc. Forensic Science Duration : 2 Years\nB.Sc. (H) Information Technology Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3 Years\nB.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent Duration : 3Years\nM.Sc. Information Technology Eligibility : B.Sc. IT Duration : 2 Years\nM.Sc. Forensic Science Eligibility : B.Sc. Forensic Science Duration : 2 Years\n\\n===== mu_catalog_11.html =====\nApply Now\nB.Tech Electrical & Electronics Engineering\nMathematics and Engineering Sciences: Calculus, Differential Equations, Linear Algebra, Probability and Statistics, Physics, and Chemistry.\nBasic Engineering: Engineering Graphics, Engineering Mechanics, and Engineering Thermodynamics.\nCore Electrical and Electronics Engineering: Electrical Circuit Analysis, Electrical Machines, Power Systems, Control Systems, Analog and Digital Electronics, Microprocessors, Signals and Systems, Electromagnetic Theory, Power Electronics, and Instrumentation.\nSpecialized Subjects: Depending on your interests and the curriculum of your university, you may have the option to choose elective courses in areas such as Renewable Energy Systems, Robotics, Embedded Systems, VLSI Design, Communication Systems, and more.\nLaboratory Work: Hands-on experience is an integral part of the program, and you will have the opportunity to work in electrical and electronics engineering laboratories to gain practical skills and apply theoretical concepts.\nElectronics Manufacturing Industry: Electronics engineers play a crucial role in the manufacturing sector, designing and developing electronic components, circuit boards, and systems. They are involved in quality control, testing, and troubleshooting of electronic devices and equipment.\nConsumer Electronics: This industry includes the development of consumer electronic products such as smart phones , televisions, audio systems, home appliances, and wearable devices. Electronics engineers contribute to the design, integration, and improvement of these products, as well as work on miniaturization and power optimization.\nSemiconductor Industry: Electronics engineers are in demand in the semiconductor industry, which involves the design, fabrication, and testing of semiconductor devices and integrated circuits (ICs). They work on cutting-edge technologies, such as microprocessors, memory chips, and sensors.\nTelecommunications: With the advancement of communication technologies, electronics engineers play a vital role in the development of telecommunications systems. They work on areas like wireless communication, network infrastructure, signal processing, and data transmission.\nEmbedded Systems: Embedded systems are prevalent in various industries , including automotive, aerospace, healthcare, and industrial automation. Electronics engineers work on designing and programming embedded systems that control and monitor devices and processes.\nResearch and Development (R&D): Electronics engineers have opportunities to work in research and development organizations, both in the public and private sectors. They contribute to advancements in electronics technology, innovation, and the development of new products and systems.\nDefense and Aerospace: Electronics engineers play a critical role in defense and aerospace industries, where they work on the design, development, and maintenance of communication systems, radar systems, navigation systems, and avionics.\nAutomation and Robotics: Electronics engineers are involved in developing control systems and circuits for automation and robotics applications. They work on sensor integration, actuator control, and overall system design.\nRenewable Energy: With the growing demand for renewable energy sources, electronics engineers contribute to the development of solar panels, wind turbines, and energy storage systems. They work on power conversion, control systems, and grid integration.\nEntrepreneurship and Consulting: Electronics engineers with a strong technical background and business acumen can start their own ventures in electronics product development, consulting firms, or offer specialized services in the field.\nProgrammes Offered\nB.Tech Electrical & Electronics Engineering Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 4 Years Apply Now\nB.Tech Electrical & Electronics Engineering Eligibility : 10+2 Duration : 4 Years\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
