{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'tmpbase=\"${TMPDIR:-/var/folders}\"; i=0; for u in '\"'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/about/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/contact/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/recognition-and-approvals/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/phd-admission/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/admission/eligibility-criteria/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-agriculture/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-humanities-and-social-sciences/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-engineering-technology/' 'https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-medical-and-allied-health-science/'; do i=\"'$((i+1)); out=\"$tmpbase/mu_identity_$i.html\"; curl --insecure -L --fail --silent --show-error --max-time 30 -A '\"'Mozilla/5.0' \\\"\"'$u\" -o \"$out\" || { echo \"FAIL $u\"; continue; }; echo \"--- $u ---\"; python3 -c '\"'from bs4 import BeautifulSoup; import sys,re; s=BeautifulSoup(open(sys.argv[1],encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\",errors=\\\"ignore\\\"),\\\"html.parser\\\"); [x.decompose() for x in s([\\\"script\\\",\\\"style\\\",\\\"noscript\\\",\\\"svg\\\",\\\"nav\\\",\\\"header\\\",\\\"footer\\\"])]; root=s.find(\\\"main\\\") or s.find(\\\"article\\\") or s.body; out=[]; [out.append(\\\" \\\".join(x.get_text(\\\" \\\",strip=True).split())) for x in root.find_all([\\\"title\\\",\\\"h1\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"h3\\\",\\\"h4\\\",\\\"h5\\\",\\\"h6\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"td\\\",\\\"th\\\",\\\"address\\\"])]; print(\\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\".join([x for x in out if x and len(x)<500])[:10000])' \\\"\"'$out\" | head -120; done'","aggregated_output":"--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/about/ ---\nAbout Mangalayatan University\\nThe Mangalayatan University has emerged as a well-known brand in northern India and is expanding fast all over the country with plans to be an international destination.\\nTo cater to the ever-growing popularity of the prestigious Mangalayatan University (MU) of Aligarh, a new well-designed, lush green, sophisticated student-friendly campus has now been opened in Jabalpur. It is called the Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur.\\nThe new campus is located at Barela, about 15 km from city centre of Jabalpur. The new university is aimed at helping the students and scholars of Madhya Pradesh and the neighbouring states in the central regions of India. The campus is well-connected and easily accessible.\\nQuick Links\\nAbout Us\\nProgramme\\nResearch\\nPlacement Support\\nLife @ Campus\\nRecognitions\\nLibrary\\nThe Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur is the outcome of the encouraging and jubilant experience of over a decade by Mangalayatan University, Aligarh. The pioneers and academic leaders of Mangalayatan, Aligarh and other top-notch acclaimed universities have already been inducted by Mangalayatan, Jabalpur to commence its academic journey from the 2022-23 session.\\nAs embodied in its ordinances, the Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, will grant scholarships and other extensive supports to deserving students to encourage them in pursuance of higher education. The Mangalayatan considers providing quality higher education as its foremost duty to the society and nation.\\nMoreover, the MU has kept its fee structure affordable to help all strata of society, of course, without compromising the quality ethos and facilities.\\nThe MU comprises schools, institutes and faculties with independent infrastructure and support systems. The administrative set up of the university is based on modern management strategies of decentralization where in issues are addressed at the source by concerned offices with delegated authorities to such offices by the competent authority.\\nWe welcome you to avail this grand opportunity of learning and serving the nation as motto of Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh\\nMission\\nVision\\n– The vision of Mangalayatan University (Jabalpur) is to eventually become an institution of excellence in higher education and research in the central regions of India, and of nationwide and international prestige, through unflinching dedication to the missions mentioned below, and thus to promote further perennially the educational, industrial, social, and economic prosperity of the nation.\\nFacilities\\nIndustry oriented Curriculum\\nGlobally recognised Programs\\nEco-Friendly Big Campus\\nEminent faculty from Academia & Industry\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nUpto 100% Scholarship for meritorious Students\\nIndoor & Outdoor Sports facility\\nCentrally AC Classrooms\\nDynamic Placement Cell\\nScholarships & Stipend from Government\\nCore values Adherence & Disciplined Environment\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nExcellent Library, Laboratories at Hi-tech Computer Labs\\nIndustrial / Educational Tour for hands-on Learning\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/contact/ ---\nContact Info\\nMangalayatan University, Jabalpur\\n+91-8252-200-200, 8252-300-300\\ninfo@mangalayatan.ac.in\\nCampus Address : NH-30, Mandla Road, Near Sharda Devi Mandir, Richhai, Barela, Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh-483001\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/recognition-and-approvals/ ---\nUNIVERSITY GRANTS COMMISSION (UGC)\\nMangalayatan University are fully Government Recognised: Recognised by University Grants Commission (UGC)\\nMangalayatan University and the Degrees awarded by them are recognized by the UGC.\\nLetter of UGC on Recognition of Mangalayatan University\\nMadhya Pradesh Private University Regulatory Commission (MPPURC)\\nMadhya Pradesh Private University Regulatory Commission (MPPURC) – Mangalayatan University is a member of the Madhya Pradesh Private University Regulatory Commission (MPPURC), ensuring top-quality education and adherence to the highest academic standards.\\nASSOCIATION OF INDIAN UNIVERSITIES (AIU)\\nMangalayatan University is a member of the Association of Indian Universities (AIU). Based on the membership of AIU, the degree, diploma and other professional programmes offered by the University are recognized by the University Grant Commission (UGC). Click Here\\nBAR COUNCIL OF INDIA (BCI)\\nLaw Programmes accredited by Bar Council of India\\nLetter of BCI on Recognition of Mangalayatan University\\nPHARMACY COUNCIL OF INDIA (PCI)\\nDepartment of Pharmaceutical Sciences, Mangalayatan University Jabalpur is Approved by Pharmacy Council of India (PCI), that permits the University to offer Pharmaceutical Science programmes.\\nNational Cadet Corps (NCC)\\nLetter of NCC on Recognition of Mangalayatan University. Click Here\\nNational Service Scheme (NSS)\\nThe NSS issued a letter recognizing Mangalayatan University for its exceptional community service efforts and dedication to the NSS’s principles.\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/phd-admission/ ---\nIMPORTANT NOTIFICATION\\nApplication Fee\\nRs. 1500\\nLast Date of Submission of Application:\\n5th February 2026\\nDate of Entrance Test\\n15th February 2026\\nExam Mode\\nMangalayatan University will take PhD Admission Test through online mode with webcam enabled online examination evaluation technique.\\nMode of Payment\\nApply Online DD in favour of \"Mangalayatan University\" payable at Jabalpur/ NEFT/ Cash Deposit\\nPhd Course Fee\\nRs. 5000/- for Registration, Rs. 90,000/- for Program Fee (Per Year) Rs. 10,000/- for Course Work & Synopsis, RS. 10,000/- for Thesis Submission and Viva Charge.\\nRs. 5000/- for Registration,\\nRs. 90,000/- for Program Fee (Per Year)\\nRs. 10,000/- for Course Work & Synopsis,\\nRS. 10,000/- for Thesis Submission and Viva Charge.\\nApplications are invited for admission to Ph.D Programme of various faculties under Mangalayatan University for the session 2026. Admission to the Ph.D Programme will be made through the Research Entrance Aptitude Test (TREAT) and interviews as per Ph.D. Regulation of the University which is based on UGC\\nOnline Application Form\\nDownload Application Form\\nMangalayatan University Research Entrance Test - MURET\\nPhd Programmes\\nEligibility Criteria\\nCourse Fee\\nFAQ's\\nPhd Programmes Offered\\nComputer Science\\nAgriculture\\nManagement\\nLaw\\nPharmacy\\nHorticulture\\nForensic Science\\nPolitical Science\\nCommerce\\nForestry\\nEconomics\\nPsychology\\nSociology\\nEnglish\\nEligibility Criteria\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University or Institution thereto in a relevant subject with minimum 55% marks or an equivalent grade.\\nFor candidates belonging to SC/ST/OBC (Non-Creamy layer)/ Differently-Abled and such other categories, relaxation as per the decision of the UGC & Govt. of India will be accorded.\\nCandidates who have already passed UGC (JRF) Examinations/ NET/ SET/ SELT or have M. Phil degree can directly appear for interview.\\nPh.D. Course Fee:\\nRs. 5000/- for Registration,\\nRs. 90,000/- for Program Fee (Per Year)\\nRs. 10,000/- for Course Work & Synopsis,\\nRS. 10,000/- for Thesis Submission and Viva Charge.\\nFAQ's\\nWhy should I consider Mangalayatan University Jabalpur for Ph.D Admission?\\nThe well-established and fast pacing Mangalayatan university has been offering top-notch program of PhD. This UGC recognized university has the sole objective of nurturing the minds of the students, to assist them in reaching their maximum potential. The proficiency faculty, fully equipped lab and updated academics are the key highlights of this institution.\\nHow to contact MUJ for Ph.D Admission?\\nThe students willing to propel their career in the direction of success, should contact for PhD Admission at MU, Jabalpur, using the contact details mentioned below. The contact can be done by both the online and the offline methods. The contact details are:\\nE-mail Id: research@mangalayatan.ac.in WhatsApp/Viber : +91-8252-200-200\\nHow Many subjects are offered by MUJ for Ph.D?\\nMUJ offered various subjects for the convenience and interest of the students. These subjects are all in relevance of the current trends in the various sectors. The subjects include Management, Commerce, English, Economics, Law, Agriculture, Forestry, Horticulture, Political Science, Sociology & Psychology\\nDoes MUJ Provide Guide/Supervisor for the students?\\nYes, MUJ provides Guide/Supervisor for the student to assist them in their thesis. They are quite helpful and knowledgeable, providing complete assistance to the aspiring students.\\nHow to Apply for Ph.D Application\\n1 Fill the Application Form (Online / Offline)\\n2 Confirm Programme/ Specialisation Fill Complete Details\\n3 Fill Educational Details & Upload Photo Signature & Documents\\n4 Proceed with the Payment of the application fee i.e. INR 1500 /-\\nOnline Application Form\\nDownload Application Form\\nRECOGNITIONS & ACCREDITATIONS\\nUNIVERSITY GRANTS COMMISSION\\nASSOCIATION OF INDIAN UNIVERSITIES\\nBAR COUNCIL OF INDIA\\nPHARMACY COUNCIL OF INDIA\\n2000 + STUDENTS FROM INDIA AND ABROAD\\n100 + FACULTIES FROM TOP INSTITUTIONS\\n1000 + STUDENTS CAMPUS EMPLOYMENT\ncurl: (56) The requested URL returned error: 404\nFAIL https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/admission/eligibility-criteria/\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-agriculture/ ---\nDepartment of Agriculture, MU Jabalpur\\nAgriculture is the pillar of the Indian economy and a highly valued occupation that brings us in touch with nature, food, and sustenance. With evolving technology and an increased population, the occupation of agriculture has broadened to encompass new methods of farming, horticulture, forestry, and agricultural science. Students now have several career choices within this occupation other than conventional farming.\\nProgrammes Offered\\nS No.\\nPROGRAMME\\nDURATION\\nELIGIBILITY\\nMODE\\nLinks\\n1\\nB.Sc (Hons.) Agriculture\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n2\\nB.Sc (Hons.) Forestry\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n3\\nB.Sc (Hons.) Horticulture\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\