 human behavior, cultures, politics, languages, and the functioning of society. The increasing significance of communication, emotional intelligence, mental well-being, and global concerns has turned experts in humanities and social sciences into highly sought-after candidates in all walks of life.\\nMangalayatan University, Jabalpur, provides career-driven and well-scholarized education in this discipline through its Department of Humanities and Social Sciences. The department offers undergraduate (BA) and postgraduate (MA) courses in core subjects including English, economics, sociology, psychology, and political science. The courses are framed to develop analytical, communicative, research, and leadership capabilities in the students.\\nProgrammes Offered\\nS No.\\nPROGRAMME\\nDURATION\\nELIGIBILITY\\nMODE\\nLinks\\n1\\nBA in English\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n2\\nBA in Economics\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n3\\nBA in Sociology\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n4\\nBA in Psychology\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n5\\nBA in Political Science\\n3 Years\\n12th\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n6\\nMA in English\\n2 Years\\nBA in English\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n7\\nMA in Economics\\n2 Years\\nBA in Economics\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n8\\nMA Sociology\\n2 Years\\nBA in sociology\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n9\\nMA in Psychology\\n2 Years\\nBA in psychology\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n10\\nMA in Political Science\\n2 Years\\nBA in political science\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n12\\nPhD in English\\n3 Years\\nPost Graduation\\nSemester\\nView Details A