.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n14\\nMBA in Marketing Management\\n3 Years\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n15\\nMBA in HR Management\\n3 Years\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n16\\nMBA in Business Analytics\\n3 Years\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\n17\\nMBA in International Business\\n3 Years\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nView Details\\nApply Now\\nLife @ Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur\\nIndustry oriented Curriculum\\nGlobally recognised Programs\\nEco-Friendly Big Campus\\nEminent faculty from Academia & Industry\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nUpto 100% Scholarship for meritorious Students\\nIndoor & Outdoor Sports facility\\nCentrally AC Classrooms\\nDynamic Placement Cell\\nScholarships & Stipend from Government\\nCore values Adherence & Disciplined Environment\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nExcellent Library, Laboratories at Hi-tech Computer Labs\\nIndustrial / Educational Tour for hands-on Learning\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-commerce/ ---\nDepartment of Commerce, MU Jabalpur\\nShaping Future Financial Professionals with B.Com and M.Com Courses\\nTrade is at the core of every economy, and the need for professionals who have a solid understanding of trade, finance, taxation, and economics only grows. Sensing the central role played by education in commerce in building business settings, Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, has established a well-equipped Department of Commerce with two flagship programs—Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) and Master of Commerce (M.Com).\\nThe department makes every effort to make students academically well-equipped with commerce subjects as well as analytical, financial, and business abilities. If one is starting their studies after 10+2 or wishing to improve their career prospects after graduation, the Department of Commerce at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, provides the right learning environment and industry interaction.\\nProgrammes Offered\\nS No.\\nPROGRAMME\\nDURATION\\nELIGIBILITY\\nMODE\\nLinks\\n1\\nB.Com\\n3 Years\\n12th with 50% Marks\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\n2\\nM.Com\\n2 Years\\nBachelor’s Degree\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\n3\\nPhD in Commerce\\n3 Years\\nMaster’s Degree\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nLife @ Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur\\nIndustry oriented Curriculum\\nGlobally recognised Programs\\nEco-Friendly Big Campus\\nEminent faculty from Academia & Industry\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nUpto 100% Scholarship for meritorious Students\\nIndoor & Outdoor Sports facility\\nCentrally AC Classrooms\\nDynamic Placement Cell\\nScholarships & Stipend from Government\\nCore values Adherence & Disciplined Environment\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nExcellent Library, Laboratories at Hi-tech Computer Labs\\nIndustrial / Educational Tour for hands-on Learning\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-forensic-science/ ---\nDepartment of Forensic Science (B.Sc. and M.Sc. Forensic Science)\\nMangalayatan University, Jabalpur, has a renowned Forensic Science Department that gives Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) and Master of Science (M.Sc.) degrees in forensic science. These two courses are specifically designed to produce talented forensic personnel with a sound theory foundation, investigative techniques, law, and laboratory training.\\nProgramme Offered\\nS No.\\nPROGRAMME\\nDURATION\\nELIGIBILITY\\nMODE\\nLinks\\n1\\nBachelor of Science (B.Sc.) in Forensic Science\\n3 Years\\n10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology/Mathematics from a known board with a minimum of 45% marks.\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\n2\\nMaster of Science (M.Sc.) in Forensic Science\\n2 Years\\nBachelor’s degree in B.Sc. (Forensic Science or equivalent science stream) from a recognized university with a minimum of 50% marks.\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\n3\\nPhD in Foreinsic Science\\n3 Years\\nMasters Degree/M.Phil from any Recognized University\\nSemester\\nView Details Apply Now\\nLife @ Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur\\nIndustry oriented Curriculum\\nGlobally recognised Programs\\nEco-Friendly Big Campus\\nEminent faculty from Academia & Industry\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nUpto 100% Scholarship for meritorious Students\\nIndoor & Outdoor Sports facility\\nCentrally AC Classrooms\\nDynamic Placement Cell\\nScholarships & Stipend from Government\\nCore values Adherence & Disciplined Environment\\nDigital Classroom & Wi-fi Campus\\nExcellent Library, Laboratories at Hi-tech Computer Labs\\nIndustrial / Educational Tour for hands-on Learning\n--- https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-information-technology/ ---\nDepartment of Information Technology, MU Jabalpur\\nMangalayatan University, Jabalpur\\nInformation Technology (IT) is one of the world’s fastest-growing industries. IT plays a very significant role in nearly every area, such as education, healthcare, business, communication, and entertainment. Nowadays, nearly all companies and even the government use IT to keep their operations running smoothly. This indicates that IT is one of the most promising career options for students who have a fondness for computers, software, and technology.\\nSelecting IT as a profession can enable the students to create a solid future. There are numerous positions available for IT graduates in India and internationally as well. Furthermore, the need for talented IT professionals continues to grow, resulting in superior job security and decent paychecks. If you like working on computers, finding solutions, and acquiring new knowledge, then IT is an ideal career option for you.\\