 also opt for specific certifications and diploma courses in specific areas such as cyber law, intellectual property rights, international law, and corporate law. If students are interested in pursuing their career in the judiciary field, they can opt for judiciary exams. They can also opt for international opportunities in the field of law by pursuing international legal studies.\n263: Why Choose MUJ for LLM Course Admission?\n264: Here are the reasons to choose Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, for the LLM course:\n268: Research-oriented program with dissertation work.\n283: The MA English program is a full-time, on-campus course with regular classroom sessions.\n286: Higher Education Opportunity After LLM Program\n287: After completing the LLM course at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, students have many opportunities to enhance their academic and professional careers. They can opt for a Ph.D. in law and pursue their career in research and academic fields. They can also opt for specific certifications and diploma courses in specific areas such as cyber law, intellectual property rights, international law, and corporate law. If students are interested in pursuing their career in the judiciary field, they can opt for judiciary exams. They can also opt for international opportunities in the field of law by pursuing international legal studies.\n290: What is the duration of the LLM program?\n291: The LLM program is a 2-year postgraduate degree in law.\n292: Who is eligible for admission to the LLM course?\n293: Candidates with an LLB or equivalent law degree from a recognized institution are eligible.\n294: Why should I pursue an LLM?\n295: An LLM helps you gain advanced legal knowledge and specialization in a particular area of law.\n296: Does the program include research work?\n298: What are the career prospects after an LLM?\n302: Globally recognised Programs\n328: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n331: Top Programmes\n367: BA LLB\n368: LLB (Hons)\n369: LL