nals who can contribute to the development and implementation of artificial intelligence and machine learning is high. By pursuing a course in BTech AI & ML at Mangalayatan University Jabalpur, students can be a part of the growing technological revolution.\n190: Programme Overview\n191: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Eligibility Criteria at Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n192: For students who are interested in pursuing the B.Tech. (CSE) course in artificial intelligence and machine learning at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, they need to ensure that they meet the eligibility criteria set by the university for admission into this course. The eligibility criteria are that students need to have completed their higher secondary education, or 10+2, from a recognized board of education with physics, chemistry, and mathematics as their core subjects with at least 50% marks.\n193: This ensures that students have a basic understanding of science and mathematics, which is required for engineering courses. Students who are naturally curious about technology, programming, and data analysis tend to find this course very engaging, as they get a chance to learn about advanced technology concepts.\n194: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Duration\n195: The BTech (CSE) in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning program has a duration of four years, which is further divided into eight semesters. In each semester, students are exposed to new subjects that further enhance their knowledge in computer science and artificial intelligence technology.\n196: In these four years, students are exposed to learning activities that include classroom learning, practice, workshops, internships, and development. In the last year of the program, students are expected to work on a comprehensive project that demonstrates their ability to apply artificial intelligence and machine learning technology for problem-solving.\n197: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Objectives\n198: The primary objective of the BTech AI & ML course is to ensure that students are ready to face the technological challenges of the modern world. The course is designed in a way that it not only provides students with a good understanding of computer science but also allows them to be exposed to various advanced artificial intelligence tools and techniques that are being used in various industries.\n199: The other objective of this course is to ensure that students are able to demonstrate good analytical thinking skills, which will enable them to be good problem solvers in designing intelligent solutions for various problems. The course encourages students to be innovative thinkers who are capable of making contributions to technology development.\n200: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Outcomes\n201: Students who have completed the B.Tech. (CSE) in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning course will be able to apply their knowledge of computer science as well as their skills in artificial intelligence technologies. This means that they will be able to analyze data, develop machine learning models, and build intelligent systems that are able to learn and improve.\n202: Students who have completed the course will also be able to apply their programming, logical thinking, and problem-solving skills, which will help them perform in a variety of multidisciplinary environments within the technology industry.\n203: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Curriculum\n204: The curriculum for the B.Tech (CSE) in AI & ML course is well planned, which enables students to move from basic computer science concepts to advanced concepts in artificial intelligence. In the initial stages of the course, students are encouraged to learn programming skills and computer science concepts. These are fundamental concepts that help students develop logical thinking and analytical skills, which are necessary for pursuing a career in artificial intelligence.\n205: As students progress in their course, they are introduced to computer science concepts that are related to artificial intelligence and machine learning. They are able to learn how a machine processes information, how algorithms are trained using data, and how they are able to develop intelligent systems for solving complex problems. Data structures, artificial intelligence, machine learning, deep learning, data analytics, computer vision, natural language processing, and cloud computing are some of the concepts that are incorporated into their course of study.\n207: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Fee Structure\n208: It is a significant investment in a student’s future if they are planning to pursue a professional course in engineering, and Mangalayatan University Jabalpur is committed to providing quality education to students who are interested in pursuing a career in modern technologies. The fee structure for the BTech CSE course in AI and ML is such that it provides a balance between cost and investment in education.\n209: Students who are interested in pursuing a course in B.Tech in AI and ML are encouraged to contact the university admission office for more information on the latest fee structure, scholarships, and financial assistance schemes. The university provides scholarships for meritorious students who have shown academic excellence in their studies, and these scholarships are provided to ensure that talented students are able to pursue their course in engineering without any undue burden on their minds.\n210: BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Admission Process\n211: The admission procedure for the B.Tech (CSE) in AI & ML program at Mangalayatan University, located in Jabalpur, is quite simple. The admission procedure starts when aspiring students submit their application form by visiting the admission portal or contacting the admission department. After submitting their details by filling out the application form, the admission department reviews the application.\n212: Once the admission criteria are met by the aspiring student, they are informed that they have a confirmed seat in the program. The last part of the admission procedure involves the enrollment procedure by paying fees and verifying the documents. Since the number of students interested in pursuing a course in a specialized branch of engineering like artificial intelligence and machine learning is high, students are usually encouraged to apply early for a confirmed seat.\n213: Top Advantages of Pursuing a BTech (CSE) in AI & ML\n214: It is considered a futuristic decision for a student to opt for a course in B.Tech. in artificial intelligence and machine learning, as the world is shifting rapidly toward intelligent technologies. Artificial intelligence is no longer a phenomenon limited to research environments; it is being applied in healthcare, finance, transportation, e-commerce, education, and many other industries. The increased usage of AI technologies has given rise to a huge demand for individuals who are proficient in handling intelligent systems.\n216: The next advantage that a student may enjoy by choosing this course is that the scope for artificial intelligence professionals is all over the world. There are a number of job prospects that are available for skilled engineers. For those who enjoy problem-solving, innovation, and exploration, artificial intelligence is a great career option.\n217: Top Career Options After BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course\n220: Top Recruiters After BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course\n223: Higher Education Opportunity After BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Program\n224: There are many students who prefer to pursue their higher studies even after completing their BTech degree in artificial intelligence and machine learning. The students can specialize in their higher studies by pursuing their master’s degree in fields like advanced artificial intelligence research, data science, or robotics.\n226: Why Choose MUJ for BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Admission\n227: Mangalayatan University Jabalpur has established a reputation as a university that emphasizes practical learning and career-focused education. For B.Tech AI & ML course admission for students who want to make a career in the field, the university provides a platform for academic learning that is infused with technological advancements.\n229: Faculty of Engineering for BTech (CSE) in AI & ML\n230: When students choose a B.Tech. (CSE) in artificial intelligence and machine learning, one of the most important factors they consider is the quality of faculty and the academic environment. At Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, the Faculty of Engineering focuses on creating a learning atmosphere where students feel encouraged to explore technology, experiment with ideas, and develop the confidence to build intelligent systems. The faculty members guiding the BTech AI & ML program bring a blend of academic knowledge and practical industry exposure, which allows students to understand how artificial intelligence and machine learning are actually used in the real world.\n232: The academic environment at Mangalayatan University is also focused on providing a practical learning experience for the students. They get access to computer facilities that help them experiment with programming languages, machine learning, and artificial intelligence. Working on projects, participating in coding competitions, and working in teams is a part of the learning environment that helps the students acquire knowledge in a supportive and innovation-driven environment. This helps them acquire not only knowledge in the field of technology but also creativity, which is essential for the technology industry.\n233: Why Choose MUJ for BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Admission\n235: Globally Recognized Programs\n248: What is the course BTech AI & ML all about?\n249: A BTech course in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning is a course that teaches computers to think, learn, and decide like a human. It includes the study of data analysis, algorithms, neural networks, and automation.\n251: Yes, it is a very promising career option. It is one of the fastest-growing courses. All companies need experts in AI for the automation of tasks and prediction.\n252: What skills will I acquire if I choose to do this course?\n253: You will acquire the skills of a programmer, data analyst, problem solver, logical thinker, and will be able to work with AI tools.\n254: What are the eligibility criteria for this course?\n256: What are the career options available to me if I choose to pursue a course in AI & ML?\n259: Yes, the course includes lab work, live projects, internships, and industry exposure to help you gain real-world experience.\n260: Can I pursue higher studies after this course?\n261: Absolutely. You can go for an MTech, MBA, or specialized certifications in AI, data science, or related fields.\n262: Start Your B.Tech (CSE) in AI & ML Course Journey Today\n264: For students who wish to make a career in artificial intelligence and machine learning, the B.Tech. in CSE in artificial intelligence and machine learning at Mangalayatan University in Jabalpur can be a great start. The course can be a great start for students who are curious about technology and passionate about innovation.\n268: Globally recognised Programs\n294: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n297: Top Programmes\n336: LLM 2Year Law Course\n346: Department of Information Technology Toggle child menu Expand\n350: B.Sc. Forensic Science\n361: B.Sc. (H) Agriculture\n362: B.Sc (Hons.) horticulture\n363: B.Sc (Hons.) Forestry\n400: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n456: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n=== department-of-engineering-technology/btech-cse-data-science/ (  312923 bytes)\n0: BTech (CSE) Data Science Admission 2026 – Course Details & Fees Mangalayatan University Jabalpur - Best University in Madhya Pradesh\n1: Skip to content\n36: LLM 2Year Law Course\n46: Department of Information Technology Expand\n50: B.Sc. Forensic Science\n61: B.Sc. (H) Agriculture\n62: B.Sc (Hons.) horticulture\n63: B.Sc (Hons.) Forestry\n100: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n156: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n180: Duration\n181: 4 Years Programme\n182: Eligibility\n186: Overview of the BTech (CSE) Data Science\n187: The B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering (CSE) with a specialization in Data Science at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, is a program that is aimed at preparing the student for the ever-growing data-driven world. This program is focused on providing a solid foundation in computer science with a specialization in data analysis, machine learning, artificial intelligence, and big data technologies.\n188: The program covers basic topics such as programming, data structures, algorithms, database management, and statistics, as well as advanced topics such as Python, R, and data visualization. The program is also focused on providing a learning experience for the student, as it helps the student understand the concepts of extracting useful information from complex data. This program is ideal for the current industry, as there is a growing demand for data professionals. This program can provide opportunities for a wide range of roles, from a data analyst to a data scientist to an AI specialist.\n189: Programme Overview\n190: BTech Data Science Eligibility Criteria at Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n197: BTech Data Science Course Duration\n198: The B.Tech in Data Science program offered at the Jabalpur campus of the university is a four-year undergraduate program, which equips students with in-depth knowledge in the domain of data science and computer science engineering. The program is divided into eight semesters, with each semester including theoretical as well as practical knowledge in the subject. The initial years of the program are used to lay a strong foundation in the subject, with students learning the concepts of programming, mathematics, and basic engineering concepts. The subsequent years of the program are used to introduce students to advanced concepts in the subject, including machine learning, data analytics, artificial intelligence, big data technologies, etc. The final year of the program is used for internships, allowing students to learn the subject in a real-world setting, thus enhancing their employability in the data science domain.\n199: BTech Data Science Course Objectives\n200: To build a strong foundation in computer science and programming concepts.\n210: BTech Data Science Course Outcomes\n211: Ability to apply programming and computer science fundamentals effectively.\n221: Top Advantages of Pursuing a BTech in Data Science\n226: Strong foundation in programming, statistics, and analytics.\n232: BTech Data Science Admission Process\n237: Application is reviewed based on eligibility and merit.\n244: Top Career Options After BTech (CSE) in AI & ML Top Career Options After BTech Data Science Course\n245: Here are the top career options after a B.Tech in data science course:\n257: Faculty of Engineering for BTech (CSE) Data Science at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur\n261: Why Choose MUJ for BTech Data Science Course Admission\n262: Here are the reasons to choose MUJ for the B.Tech Data Science course admission.\n274: What is BTech Data Science?\n275: It is a course in which you learn how to collect, analyze, and interpret large amounts of data and make better decisions in both business and technology-related fields.\n278: What subjects are covered in this course?\n279: Statistics, data analysis, programming, machine learning, big data technology, and data visualization are some of the subjects you’ll study in this course.\n281: Yes, coding is also necessary in this field, especially in languages like Python and R, but you don’t need to know them before joining this course because you’ll learn them from scratch.\n282: What job roles can I get after this course?\n283: You can become a data scientist, data analyst, business analyst, or data engineer or work in AI-related jobs. 6. Does this course include real-world projects?\n287: Higher Education Opportunity After BTech Data Science Program\n288: After completing their B.Tech in Data Science at Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, there are a wide variety of options available to them to further enhance their knowledge in this field and move ahead in their respective careers. They can choose to do an M.Tech/M.S. in Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, or Computer Science to further enhance their knowledge in this field. Students can also choose to do an MBA in business analytics, IT, or operations if they want to move into a managerial role in this field. Students can also choose to do a postgraduate diploma or a certification program in big data, cloud computing, data analytics, etc., from a reputable institution. Students can also choose to do a Ph.D. in data science if they are more interested in a research career in this field.\n292: Globally recognised Programs\n318: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n321: Top Programmes\n360: LLM 2Year Law Course\n370: Department of Information Technology Toggle child menu Expand\n374: B.Sc. Forensic Science\n385: B.Sc. (H) Agriculture\n386: B.Sc (Hons.) horticulture\n387: B.Sc (Hons.) Forestry\n424: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n480: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n=== department-of-engineering-technology/btech-cse-cyber-security/ (  316451 bytes)\n0: BTech CSE Cyber Security Admission 2026 – Course Details & Fees Mangalayatan University Jabalpur - Best University in Madhya Pradesh\n1: Skip to content\n36: LLM 2Year Law Course\n46: Department of Information Technology Expand\n50: B.Sc. Forensic Science\n61: B.Sc. (H) Agriculture\n62: B.Sc (Hons.) horticulture\n63: B.Sc (Hons.) Forestry\n100: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n156: National Ragging Prevention Programme\n180: Duration\n181: 4 Years Programme\n182: Eligibility\n186: Faculty of Engineering for BTech (CSE) Cyber S