niversity, Jabalpur. Due to the rapid expansion of the IT industry, new ground has been created for computer application courses in the job market. While the ever-growing demand for IT professionals has made computer application programmes the need of the hour. Recognizing this need, the prominent and innovative Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, offers top-notch computer application programmes at diverse academic levels, including Undergraduate (BCA), and Postgraduate (MCA). The Department's experienced faculty, combined with a dynamic and innovative curriculum that takes advantage of the latest technologies, creates a fertile ground for effective knowledge dissemination and the development of the necessary skills for future professional recognition of the students.\n11: Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, is currently inviting applications for BCA and MCA admissions in 2025 from all around India. The eligibility criteria and course duration are separately mentioned below, including information about admission open in BCA and MCA programmes ; interested candidates may apply soon to secure their seats.\n12: Programmes Offered in Computer Application Department\n13: BCA\n14: Eligibility : 10+2\n15: Duration : 3 Years\n16: MCA\n17: Eligibility : Graduate with 50% marks (with Mathematics as one of the subjects)\n18: Duration : 2 Years\n=== admissions/llb-ba-llb-bcom-llb-llm-law-courses.php\n0: Law Courses | Department of Law | Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n1: Apply Online for Admission 2026-27\n2: +91-8252-200-200, +91-8252-300-300\n6: Mangalayatan University Jabalpur Faculty Of Law Courses\n8: Department Of Law Courses\n10: Mangalayatan University, one of the top universities in Jabalpur, has admissions open for undergraduate, postgraduate courses in Legal Education.\n11: Bachelors' of Legislative Law, (LLB)\n12: Legum Baccalaureus or LLB offers deep comprehension of all core aspects of law, and knowledge of different domains of legal profession such as Criminal Law, Civil Law, Corporate and Business Law, Law of Torts, Law of Contract, International Law, Cyber Law etc. This is a 3-year regular programme.\n13: Basic eligibility criterion 50% marks in graduation, from a recognized institution.\n14: BA LLB (H)\n15: For those who want to become lawyers, there is an integrated course called BA LLB (H) offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur that combines a Bachelor of Arts with a Bachelor of Laws. This five-year program offers a broad curriculum encompassing core legal subjects like criminal law, corporate law, and constitutional law and humanities subjects like political science, sociology, and economics. The purpose of the course is to foster a solid foundation in legal principles as well as analytical and critical thinking abilities. Students are prepared to work in corporate legal departments, practice law, or pursue postgraduate study in specialized legal areas.\n16: Basic Eligibility Criterion: 50% marks in 10+2, from a recognized board\n17: Master of Law (LLM)\n18: This is a 2-year post-graduate degree in law, wherein students are equipped with in-depth knowledge of their chosen field of law, by performing intensive research in that subject. The LLM Programme requires the student to select a specific field of specialization, such as, Criminal Law, Corporate Law, Tax Law etc. Overall, a degree in law will equip a student to face real-world issues more effectively.\n19: Eligibility Criterion: Graduation in any stream, from a recognized university.\n20: Law Programmes Offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n22: BA LLB\n23: Eligibility : 50% marks in 10+2\n24: Duration : 5 Years\n25: LLB\n26: Eligibility : 50% marks in graduation\n27: Duration : 3 Years\n28: LLM\n29: Eligibility : Graduation in any stream\n30: Duration : 2 Years\n=== admissions/bba-mba-management-courses.php\n0: Top Commerce and Management Courses | Mangalayatan University | Admissions Open\n1: Apply Online for Admission 2026-27\n2: +91-8252-200-200, +91-8252-300-300\n10: The department currently runs Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) and Master of Business Administration (MBA). These two management programmes are designed according to the dynamic corporate culture, changing business environment and the need of the industry.\n11: Our MBA programmes are blended with the latest industry and best business practices that equips students with in-depth subject knowledge and sublime business acumen that supports an advanced career in the sphere of management. Below are the salient features of our MBA programmes:\n12: Strong industry collaboration with top companies to ensure that our courses are relevant and according to the need of the industry\n13: MBA education is guided by the best faculty - teachers and technologists, researchers and people from the corporate world\n16: The department lays stress on experiential learning opportunities throughout the curriculum including a required internship, course assignments, and other industry-driven projects to prepare firebrand business leaders who create value for business and society. Come and join our management courses to explore your potential.\n17: Programmes Offered in Management Department\n18: BBA\n19: Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent\n20: Duration : 3 Years\n21: MBA\n22: Eligibility : Graduation\n23: Duration : 2 Years\n=== admissions/bcom-mcom-commerce-courses.php\n0: Department Of Commerce - Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n1: Apply Online for Admission 2026-27\n2: +91-8252-200-200, +91-8252-300-300\n9: The disciplines of accounting and commerce have always been vastly popular among students for years, and continue to be so, attributable to the many career opportunities that present themselves after the programme, and scope for professional growth in many fields with many specializations being offered.\n10: The programme provides educational strength in the commerce students, more so, for students who studied commerce in 12th standard.\n11: Mangalayatan University, one of the top universities in Jabalpur, has admissions open for undergraduate, postgraduate courses in Commerce, exhibiting learner-centric teaching methods.\n13: This 3-year, Undergraduate degree course is highly in-demand among students, with a flair for numbers, and are interested in thorough learning of a variety of associated subjects, like, Accountancy, Finance, Economics, Statistics, Business Environment etc.\n14: If one aims to become a Chartered Accountant (CA), then B.Com is the way to go forward. The qualification provides a valuable base and provides course exemptions for professional qualifications like ICWA, Cost Accountancy and Company Secretary.\n15: Basic eligibility Criterion: 10+2, from a recognized board\n17: M.Com is a 2-year, postgraduate course for students who want to further pursue commerce as a subject and find professional growth in careers related to the same, such as, Banking, Accounting, Investments, Marketing, Economics, etc., with definite financial benefits as one moves higher up the career graph.\n19: Basic eligibility Criterion: Graduation in Commerce Stream, with Mathematics and Economics\n=== admissions/bpharma-dpharma-courses.php\n0: Department of Pharmacy | Mangalayatan University Jabalpur | Admissions Open\n1: Apply Online for Admission 2026-27\n2: +91-8252-200-200, +91-8252-300-300\n10: The department currently runs Diploma in Pharmacy (D.Pharm) and Bachelor of Pharmacy (B.Pharm). These two management programs are designed to enable students learn about pharmaceutical science, drug dispensing, pharmacology, and pharmaceutical chemistry.\n11: Our pharmacy programs offer a comprehensive blend of both pharmaceutical science and business management aspects. This approach seems to be designed to provide students with not only a strong foundation in the scientific and technical aspects of pharmacy but also the necessary skills and knowledge to thrive in management roles within the pharmaceutical industry.\n13: Below are the salient features of our Pharmacy programs:\n18: Pharmacy Programmes Offered by Mangalayatan University Jabalpur\n21: Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2\n22: Duration : 4 Years\n24: Eligibility : 50% Marks in PCB/PCM in 10+2\n25: Duration : 2 Years\n=== admissions/btech-mtech-courses.php\n0: Dept. of Engineering & Technology | Mangalayatan University Jabalpur | Apply Now\n1: Apply Online for Admission 2026-27\n2: +91-8252-200-200, +91-8252-300-300\n10: The department currently runs Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech) and Master of Technology (M.Tech). These Technical programs are designed according to the dynamics corporate culture, changing business environment and the need of the industry.\n11: The Department of Engineering and Technology offers programs are blended with the latest industry and best business practices that equips students with in-depth subject knowledge and sublime business acumen that supports an advanced career in the sphere of Engineering and Technology. Below are the salient features of our Technical programs:\n12: Varied Engineering courses like Computer Science at graduate and post graduate level are offered for best career progression.\n13: Theoretical and research based learning incorporates practical, hands-on experience through laboratory work are best tools for imparting technical programs. Theoretical knowledge to real-world problems helps students to acquire knowledge in the form of practical experience.\n14: Strong industry collaboration with top companies to ensure that our courses are relevant and according to the need of the industry.\n18: The department lays stress on experiential learning opportunities throughout the curriculum including a required internship, course assignments, and other industry-driven projects to prepare firebrand business leaders who create value for business and society. Come and join our Technical courses to explore your potential.\n19: Programmes Offered in Engineering Department\n20: B.Tech CSE\n21: Eligibility : 10+2 or Equivalent\n22: Duration : 4 Years\n23: M.Tech CSE\n24: Eligibility : B.Tech in relevant field\n25: Duration : 2 Years\n27: Eligibility : Post Graduate\n28: Duration : 3 Years\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
