/span>1 Year</p> --></li>\n221-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n--\n268-\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\n269-\n270:\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#\">Department Of Medical and Allied Health Science</a>\n271-\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"sciencePrograms\" class=\"courseWrapper\">\n272-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"clearfix\">\n273:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"#\">Diploma Medical Lab. Technician DMLT</a></div>\n274-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB</p><p><span>Duration :</span>2 Years</p></li>\n275:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"#\">Bachelor Medical Lab. Technician BMLT</a></div>\n276-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM</p><p><span>Duration :</span>3 Years</p></li>\n277:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"#\">Bachelor of X-Ray Radiographer Technician BXRT</a></div>\n278-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB/PCM</p><p><span>Duration :</span>3 Years</p></li>\n279:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"#\">Bachelor of Physiotherapy BPT</a></div>\n280-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>50% Marks in 10+2 with PCB</p><p><span>Duration :</span>4.5 Years</p></li>\n281-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n===mu_cat_admissions_bca-mca-computer-application-courses_php.html\n105-\t\t\t</div>\n106-\t\t\t<h1>Department Of Computer Application</h1>\n107:\t\t\t<p>The Department of Computer Application is the pioneer department of Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur. Due to the rapid expansion of the IT industry, new ground has been created for <strong>computer application courses</strong> in the job market. While the ever-growing demand for IT professionals has made computer application programmes the need of the hour. Recognizing this need, the prominent and innovative Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, offers top-notch computer application programmes at diverse academic levels, including Undergraduate (BCA), and Postgraduate (MCA). The Department's experienced faculty, combined with a dynamic and innovative curriculum that takes advantage of the latest technologies, creates a fertile ground for effective knowledge dissemination and the development of the necessary skills for future professional recognition of the students.</p>\n108-\n109:\t\t\t<p>The Department of Computer Applications teaches students to design, develop, and implement software. With state-of-the-art computer facilities, the department aspires to become a center of excellence in providing in-depth technical knowledge and opportunities for innovation and research and to produce versatile students who are ready to work in industry, government, higher education, research, and development, entrepreneurship, and other fields.</p>\n110-\t\t\t\n111:\t\t\t<p>Mangalayatan University, Jabalpur, is currently inviting applications for <strong>BCA and MCA admissions in 2025</strong> from all around India. The eligibility criteria and course duration are separately mentioned below, including information about <strong>admission open in BCA and MCA programmes</strong>; interested candidates may apply soon to secure their seats.</p> \n112-\n113-\t\t\t<div class=\"clr\"></div>\n--\n120-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-information-technology/bachelor-of-computer-application-bca-course/\">BCA</a></div>\n121-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>10+2</p><p><span>Duration :</span>3 Years</p></li>\n122:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><div class=\"courseheadingtxt\"><a href=\"https://www.mangalayatan.ac.in/department-of-information-technology/master-of-computer-application-mca-course/\">MCA</a></div>\n123-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span>Eligibility :</span>Graduate with 50% marks (with Mathematics as one of the subjects)</p><p><span>Duration :</span>2 Years</p></li>\n124-\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n===mu_cat_admissions_bsc-msc-courses_php.html\nrg: /Users/d111879/Documen